<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, July 7 (Reuter) COAL - Acina - 70,000/10 tonnes coal New Or1eans/Tarragona July $7.75/$8.00 fio 30,000 shinc/24,000 shex Carboex.</p>
<p>ORE - Amagisan - l50,000/10 tonnes ore Dampier/Rotterdam early August approx. $8 fio six days shinc CRA (reported).</p>
